Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, it's so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.79,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want,\Ntogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.71,0:01:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.98,0:01:54.36,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord2.2\c&H171615&\3c&H171615&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(484,977)\fsp-2\t(442,484,\1a&H00&)\t(3403,3445,\1a&HFF&)}Stowaway
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.98,0:01:54.36,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(484,977)\fsp-2}Stowaway
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.51,0:01:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we sank one ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.27,0:01:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one, belonging to some.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.43,0:01:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Clay, a Baroque works agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.09,0:02:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other ship was able to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.65,0:02:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you let them escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.01,0:02:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think that I fell\Nfor such a cheap trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Running away is what they do best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.11,0:02:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Hina, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.19,0:02:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's so infuriating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.51,0:02:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hina's angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.81,0:02:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anger at your own incompetence?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.39,0:02:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.66,0:02:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Outstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.58,0:02:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cage Cage Fruit is intense!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has the power to bind any\Npart of the body she touches!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.43,0:02:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a skill!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.49,0:02:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.55,0:02:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say the killer line just one time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.19,0:02:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.45,0:02:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm mad at you, Smoker. Hina's mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.37,0:02:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Care to elaborate on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.87,0:02:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that you actually seem to be\Nhappy about the Straw Hats getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.05,0:03:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.15,0:03:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.89,0:03:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.53,0:03:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At which point my dearest Vivi\Nsaid to me in a very formal manner,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have something important to\Ntalk with you about, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.35,0:03:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.79,0:03:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At that moment, I remember thinking for\Nmyself, King or no, it makes no difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.61,0:03:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no man gives up the\Ntitle daddy, watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.41,0:03:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,children grow is a bittersweet experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.89,0:03:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try as I might I cannot accept your death!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.13,0:03:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even shed one tear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.61,0:03:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is that, old friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.67,0:04:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.05,0:04:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's so funny, Toto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.79,0:04:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been laughing\Never since the speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.93,0:04:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let us in on the joke, old man,\Nbecause right now we're in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.23,0:04:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a secret, but trust\Nme, guys, it's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.09,0:04:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now have a good journey, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.91,0:04:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're welcome to drink\NYuba's water any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.77,0:04:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, that's enough. Join!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.19,0:04:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's work to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dig the bell, dig!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.53,0:04:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does anyone have a clue who\NPrincess Phoebe was talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.95,0:04:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, but who really cares anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:04:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what she said makes us happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.91,0:05:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's our duty to respond\Nto it. She's right. Well said.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.11,0:05:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though we're simply peasants.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.11,0:05:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak for yourself, peasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.85,0:05:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As expected, Alubarna seems\Nto be in bad shape. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.09,0:05:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.35,0:05:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we also have to restore\NYuba as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.09,0:05:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an important crossroad in the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.15,0:05:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't forget, we still need to repair\Nall the canals along the Century River.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.09,0:05:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about the casino?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.53,0:05:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.73,0:05:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.77,0:05:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.03,0:05:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, why's he getting special treatment?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.01,0:05:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because Princess Vivi told us to, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.31,0:05:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants to join the\NSupersonic Duck Squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.49,0:05:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a camel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.35,0:05:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What gave it away?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.75,0:06:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm off. Thank you. For everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.41,0:06:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too hasty for your own good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.53,0:06:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone with your injury\Nshouldn't even be out of bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.31,0:06:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.49,0:06:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just promise me that if you make it\Nhome, you'll take things easy and rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.31,0:06:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, you forgot this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.33,0:06:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.13,0:06:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.47,0:06:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To Alubarna.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.45,0:07:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.19,0:07:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tashigi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.10,0:07:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how are your legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.23,0:07:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're doing fine. Change the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.17,0:07:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw the new bounties on their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.33,0:07:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It amounts no surprise\Nconsidering the catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.23,0:07:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you heard what his\Nswordsman buddy did?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.71,0:07:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean Roronoa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He cut down 100 bounty\Nhunters in Whiskey Peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.25,0:07:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, in Alubarna,\Nhe killed Das Bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.73,0:07:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The assassin? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.07,0:07:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used to be a bounty hunter and\Nwas known throughout the West Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.85,0:07:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In Baroque Works, he went\Nby the alias, Mr. One.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.57,0:07:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Considering Crocodile had so many\Nfamous warriors at his command,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.27,0:07:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd think they'd be unstoppable\Nagainst any opposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.21,0:08:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, fate was not kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.75,0:08:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day, we'll have a rematch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.97,0:08:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.51,0:08:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I will defeat you, Roro no Azoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.29,0:08:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the Marines\Nhave stopped following us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.79,0:08:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shook him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.27,0:08:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.37,0:08:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with the pathetic groans?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.15,0:08:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I miss her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.47,0:08:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.07,0:08:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanted her to join that bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.75,0:08:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you shouldn't have let her leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.01,0:08:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You savage! Alabasta! Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.69,0:08:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.91,0:08:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saying three-sword style\Nisn't an insult, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.17,0:08:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not the number that's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.93,0:08:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An effective insult must\Ninvolve some personal
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.95,0:08:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,detail about the recipient\Nthat's rude or disparaging.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.77,0:08:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we finally\Nescaped the firing squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.27,0:08:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.47,0:08:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.33,0:08:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here to avenge your friends, just try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.97,0:09:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.67,0:09:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horny!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.21,0:09:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horny!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.01,0:09:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.23,0:09:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but she's so damn beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.29,0:09:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you before?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.63,0:09:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't point such dangerous objects at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.97,0:09:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you always so slow?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.43,0:09:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long have you been on our ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.19,0:09:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.41,0:09:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are your clothes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.49,0:09:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm borrowing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.99,0:09:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a minute, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.99,0:09:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.71,0:09:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.99,0:09:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hasn't been so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.73,0:09:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that you've forgotten what\Nyou did to me, has it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.87,0:09:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do to that beautiful\Nwoman, you lousy bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.79,0:09:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All stowways must leave the\Nship immediately. Me, I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. Stop lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.73,0:09:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I didn't do anything to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.77,0:09:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.68,0:09:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what you did to me was unbearable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead. Admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.59,0:09:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.57,0:09:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's she talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.95,0:09:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time that all\Nmystery chicks vacate the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.75,0:10:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ship or will be forced\Nto call the Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.69,0:10:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for voyaging\Non the going barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tear you apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.17,0:10:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.11,0:10:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to join you. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.05,0:10:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use that. Immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.07,0:10:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can neutralize the poison\Nfrom Crocodile's hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.27,0:10:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he was buried in this rubble,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.37,0:10:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a chance he might survive\Nsince he's actually rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.01,0:10:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You looked me straight\Nin the eye and told me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.51,0:10:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that the only thing\Nwritten here was history.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you lie to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.87,0:10:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.78,0:10:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.35,0:10:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is, this country's history\Nisn't written anywhere in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.27,0:10:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead, it has everything about the\Nweapon you wanted to get your hands on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.85,0:10:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The description, location.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.99,0:10:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.63,0:10:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had told Crocodile\Nthis information,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.87,0:11:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this country would now\Nbe his for the taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.39,0:11:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested whether\Npeople in this country
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.79,0:11:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Live or die, it really\Nmakes no difference to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.85,0:11:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had already decided\Nfrom the start not to give
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.43,0:11:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile the weapon I\Ndon't understand but why did
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.41,0:11:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you come here I don't\Nreally know anymore chasing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.41,0:11:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a dream I suppose an empty\Ndream the last remaining
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.27,0:11:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,poneglyph in the world\Nthat still carries the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.25,0:11:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,true history. The real
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.47,0:11:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,poneglyph what do you mean by
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.87,0:11:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the true history nothing it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.07,0:11:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't matter now for 20 years
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.13,0:11:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i've searched and i've never had\Na better lead than this this is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.89,0:11:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my last hope and it didn't work\Nout so if i'm going to die here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.25,0:12:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's the perfect time i'm tired\Nof this fool's crusade it's over
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all i wanted was to learn our true history
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and to share it with\Nthe whole world so then
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.83,0:12:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're saying that it's possible our lost
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,history could actually\Nbe uncovered and the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.53,0:12:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,poneglyphs are the key to\Nunlocking these records?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.45,0:12:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean, all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.31,0:12:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.09,0:12:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I no longer have a reason to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.41,0:12:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.55,0:12:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.05,0:12:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do what you want once we're out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.29,0:12:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted nothing more than\Nto die at that very moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.67,0:12:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you forced me to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.49,0:12:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's your crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.45,0:12:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no place for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.25,0:12:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or return to so i've\Ndecided that i'll join you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.81,0:13:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i see your problem guess\Nthere's no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.69,0:13:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome there's nothing to worry\Nabout trust me she isn't a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.73,0:13:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay attention! I want some straight up and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.85,0:13:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,honest answers i'll ask\Nyou one more time what's
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.09,0:13:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your name uh my name's\Nusa hello nico robin
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.91,0:13:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay nico robin so what's your occupation
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.65,0:13:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,archaeologist are you serious archaeology
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.75,0:13:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,runs in my blood i come\Nfrom a long line of
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.61,0:13:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was when I was eight years old that I\Ndecided to pursue archaeology as my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.47,0:14:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shortly thereafter, I found myself\Nwanted by the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.15,0:14:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since then, I've spent the past\N20 years hiding from the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.17,0:14:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.29,0:14:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since you were eight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.55,0:14:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then one day, I heard\Nthe calling of the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's no way for a child\Nto survive alone on the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.69,0:14:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only option I found\Nthat ensured my protection
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.09,0:14:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the ability to achieve my goal was...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.31,0:14:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I chose to work for various rogues,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.45,0:14:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not an ideal solution, but\Nit brought me this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.85,0:14:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.17,0:14:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm good at maneuvering through\Nobstacles to achieve a goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.35,0:14:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be a great asset to\Nyou and your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.33,0:14:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.24,0:14:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're full of confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.87,0:14:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your specialty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.45,0:14:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My investigation has concluded\Nthat she is far too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.69,0:14:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys listening to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.69,0:14:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.83,0:14:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two are pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.43,0:14:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until recently, she was the vice\Npresident of a crime syndicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.43,0:15:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you really think such\Na woman should join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.25,0:15:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have fooled these\Nidiots, but I'm not convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.15,0:15:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pull anything, and I'll\Npersonally kick you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.63,0:15:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.77,0:15:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.77,0:15:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I just remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.55,0:15:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought along some of\NCrocodile's jewelry with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.59,0:15:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I love you, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.09,0:15:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.21,0:15:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.99,0:15:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami's been had.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.25,0:15:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Chick's bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.81,0:15:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's following her lead\Nlike some kind of pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.27,0:15:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, love. Bold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.75,0:15:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The likes of which I've never seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.71,0:15:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm captured by your spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.61,0:15:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Held prisoner in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.09,0:15:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.03,0:15:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was driftwood floating at sea until you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.19,0:15:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,struck me like a thunderbolt\Nigniting my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.53,0:15:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.87,0:15:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.55,0:15:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at him falling all over himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.89,0:15:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, he was a lost\Ncause from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.03,0:16:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you and I are the only\Nholdouts on this ship of insanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.91,0:16:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't blame the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.51,0:16:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their simple minds\Ncan't resist her charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.53,0:16:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.67,0:16:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.35,0:16:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I call you, Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.41,0:16:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or something more daring\Nthat declares my love?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.59,0:16:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.51,0:16:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With an adult charm!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.19,0:16:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's far different than Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.79,0:16:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship has charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it always this lively?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.91,0:16:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it usually is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.93,0:16:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This woman's up to something. But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.95,0:16:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the forecast, Navigator?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.19,0:17:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it smooth sailing ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.39,0:17:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind is calm and\Nthe weather's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.31,0:17:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no problems on my end, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.69,0:17:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.60,0:17:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't stopped\Ngawking at that jewelry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.33,0:17:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, is our snack ready? Be patient.

